  "instructions": [
    "Bring a pot of water to a rolling boil over high heat.",
    "Add the pasta and cook for 9 to 11 minutes. Stir in the frozen peas for the final 2 minutes of cooking.",
    "Reserve some of the cooking water, then drain the pasta and peas. Return the mixture to the warm pot off the heat.",
